<title>CHINA: Jinan Qinqi 97 H1 interim up 147.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Jinan Qinqi 97 H1 interim up 147.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		 1,344.23	 vs   1,470.58</p>
<p> Net profit		 198.63	 vs	80.19</p>
<p> Net asset per share	2.46 yuan  vs	 3.06</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.20 yuan  vs	 0.32</p>
<p>Company name: Jinan Qinqi Motorcycles Co Ltd  900946.SS</p>
<p>The company issued 230 million B shares on the Shanghai Stock Exchange in May, 1997.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a statement issued by the Shanghai Stock Exchange on Monday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
</text>
